Date: Mon, 24 Feb 2025 20:31:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1303/1695] dts: stm32: remove stm32mppll3-cfg-900Mhz on
 STM32MP23 board

On STM32MP23 Soc the GPU is limited at 400MHz so remove the 900MHz
not supported by SoC.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git e3829598f156ea1d3bbe5be7c11b1fd2e87ef3a1 dts: stm32: remove stm32mppll3-cfg-900Mhz on STM32MP23 board]
Fixes: ddad7d553b0f ("dts: stm32: add STM32MP23 RCC and RIF configuration for DK board")
Signed-off-by: Patrick Delaunay <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I8873f5375b4b6fcac6b94b790d0001cd490d7d7b
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/439607
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
